%!PS-Adobe-3.0
%%Title: transform-line procedure - Chapter 4
%%Pages: 1
%%EndComments

/transform-line { 1 dict begin
  aload pop
  /C exch def /B exch def /A exch def /M exch def
  /Minv M matrix invertmatrix def
  [
    A Minv 0 get mul B Minv 1 get mul add
    A Minv 2 get mul B Minv 3 get mul add
    A Minv 4 get mul B Minv 5 get mul add C add
  ]
end } def
/Helvetica findfont 12 scalefont setfont
72 720 moveto
([1 1 -300] transformed by [1 0 0 1 50 20] -> ) show
[1 0 0 1 50 20] [1 1 -300] transform-line ==
showpage
%%EOF
